<title>BRAZIL: Bovespa sees 130.8 mln reais net inflow in March.</title>
<headline>Bovespa sees 130.8 mln reais net inflow in March.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sao Paulo Stock Exchange (Bovespa) said it registered foreign capital inflows of 130.812 million reais in March, down from 160.9 million reais in the previous month.</p>
<p>Foreign buys amounted to 3.080 billion reais, against foreign sales of 2.949 billion reais, the bolsa said.</p>
<p>So far this year, net foreign capital inflows have totalled 973.442 million reais.</p>
<p>((-- Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo Newsroom 5511 2485412))</p>
